00:07:03,333 --> 00:07:09,333
Where hope survives.

2
00:14:06,666 --> 00:14:12,666
Beyond Borders is a drama, romance, adventure film directed by Martin Campbell.

3
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:16,000
Sarah Jordan, an American living in London in 1984, is married
to the son of a wealthy British industrialist.

4
00:28:13,333 --> 00:28:19,333
She encounters Nick Callahan, a renegade doctor, whose impassioned plea for help
to support his relief efforts in war-torn Africa moves her deeply.

5
00:35:16,666 --> 00:35:22,666
As a result, Sarah embarks upon a journey of discovery that leads to
danger, heartbreak and romance in the far corners of the world.

6
00:42:20,000 --> 00:42:26,000
Sarah Jordan, played by Angelina Jolie.

7
00:49:23,333 --> 00:49:29,333
Nick Callahan, played by Clive Owen.

8
00:56:26,666 --> 00:56:32,666
Charlotte Jordan, played by Teri Polo.

9
01:03:30,000 --> 01:03:36,000
Henry Bauford, played by Linus Roache.

10
01:10:33,333 --> 01:10:39,333
Elliott Hauser, played by Noah Emmerich.

11
01:17:36,666 --> 01:17:42,666
Steiger, played by Yorick van Wageningen.

12
01:24:40,000 --> 01:24:46,000
Beyond Borders is a 2003 American romantic-drama film about aid workers, directed by  Martin
Campbell and starring Angelina Jolie, Clive Owen, Teri Polo and Kate Ashfield.

13
01:31:43,333 --> 01:31:49,333
The original music score was composed by James Horner.

14
01:38:46,666 --> 01:38:52,666
Reflecting Jolie's real-life interest in promoting humanitarian relief,
the film was critically and financially unsuccessful.

15
01:45:50,000 --> 01:45:56,000
The film was marketed with the tagline "In a place she didn't belong, among people she never knew, she found a way to make a difference."
Concurrently with the release of the film, Jolie published Notes from My
Travels, a collection of journal entries from her real-life experiences as a Goodwill Ambassador for the United Nations High Commissioner for Refugees (UNHCR) — similar to her character in the film.

16
01:52:53,333 --> 01:52:59,333
The film explores themes of london, england, central intelligence
agency (cia), cambodia, love of one's life, landmine.

17
01:59:56,666 --> 02:00:02,666
The tone is emotional and thought_provoking.
